@startuml
title Ciclo de vida del despliegue de IntenCite

top to bottom direction

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #2563EB
skinparam ArrowThickness 2
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
    BorderColor #2563EB
    FontColor #0F172A
    StartColor #16A34A
    EndColor #DC2626
}

state "1. Credenciales temporales\nAWS Academy" as Credentials
state "2. GitHub Actions\nDeploy IntenCite" as Deploy
state "3. Terraform init\nState remoto en Amazon S3" as State
state "4. Construcción de imágenes\nAPI + App" as Build
state "5. Publicación de imágenes\nAmazon ECR" as Images
state "6. Terraform apply\nInfraestructura AWS" as Apply
state "7. Nuevo deployment ECS\nEspera de servicios estables" as Stabilize
state "8. IntenCite disponible\nURL del ALB" as Running
state "9. GitHub Actions\nDestroy IntenCite" as Destroy
state "10. Terraform destroy\nEliminación de infraestructura" as Cleanup
state "11. Eliminación del bucket\nde Terraform State" as StateCleanup

[*] --> Credentials

Credentials --> Deploy : workflow_dispatch

Deploy --> State : AWS STS obtiene Account ID
State --> Build : Backend inicializado
Build --> Images : Docker build
Images --> Apply : Imágenes publicadas
Apply --> Stabilize : ECS + ALB + red + logs
Stabilize --> Running : Servicios estables

Running --> Destroy : Cuando finaliza el uso
Destroy --> Cleanup : Recupera el mismo state
Cleanup --> StateCleanup : Recursos eliminados
StateCleanup --> [*] : Cuenta limpia

note right of Credentials
GitHub Actions Secrets:

AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
AWS_SESSION_TOKEN
end note

note right of State
Bucket dinámico:

intencite-tfstate-<ACCOUNT_ID>

Key:
intencite/terraform.tfstate
end note

note right of Build
API Docker image:

FastAPI
PyTorch CPU
Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct
LoRA adapter
TF-IDF baseline

El modelo Qwen queda
empaquetado en la imagen.
end note

note right of Running
Rutas del ALB:

/          -> App
/api/*     -> API
/health    -> API
end note

@enduml